<div class="dojo-scroll" v-else><div class="dojo-empty" v-if="!filtered.length&&view!=='stats'&&view!=='daily'"><h2>还没有资源记录</h2><p>打开游戏后点击“读取全部窗口”，自动建立独立角色档案。<br>未读取或缺少邮件不代表零产出。</p><button class="dojo-primary" @click="readResources(true)">开始读取</button></div><div class="dojo-stats" v-else-if="view==='stats'"><div class="dojo-stats-tools"><label>统计范围<select aria-label="统计范围" v-model="statsRange"><option value="all">全部记录 · 累计</option><option value="month">所选月份 · {{month||today.slice(0,7)}}</option><option value="custom">自选日期</option></select></label><template v-if="statsRange==='custom'"><label>开始日期<input aria-label="统计开始日期" type="date" v-model="statsFrom"></label><label>结束日期<input aria-label="统计结束日期" type="date" v-model="statsTo"></label></template><label>汇总方式<select aria-label="汇总方式" v-model="statsGroup"><option value="role">按角色</option><option value="month">按月份</option></select></label><label>资源数值<select aria-label="统计资源数值" v-model="statsAverage"><option :value="false">累计数量</option><option :value="true">每角色记录日均</option></select></label></div><p v-if="statsInvalid" class="dojo-error">请选择有效日期，开始日期不能晚于结束日期。</p><div class="dojo-stats-metrics"><article><small>已记录角色</small><strong>{{statsSummary.roleCount}}</strong></article><article><small>奖励邮件</small><strong>{{statsSummary.mailCount}}</strong></article><article><small>有记录日期</small><strong>{{statsSummary.dayCount}}</strong></article><article><small>角色记录日</small><strong>{{statsSummary.roleDayCount}}</strong></article></div><div class="dojo-stats-resources"><article v-for="item in statsColumns" :key="item.id" :class="resourceClass(item.id)"><span><DojoIcon :id="item.id" />{{item.name}}<small v-if="item.stars">{{item.stars}} 星</small></span><b>{{statsAmount(statsSummary,item.id)}}</b></article></div><p class="dojo-stats-note">{{statsSummary.from?statsSummary.from+' — '+statsSummary.to:'暂无记录'}} · 仅统计已读取的奖励邮件。每角色记录日均按有记录的角色及日期计算，缺失日期不计为零，不代表完整战斗日均。</p><div class="dojo-stats-table"><table><thead><tr><th>{{statsGroup==='role'?'角色':'月份'}}</th><th>邮件 / 记录日</th><th v-for="item in statsColumns" :key="item.id" :class="resourceClass(item.id)">{{item.name}}<small v-if="item.stars"> {{item.stars}} 星</small></th><th>记录区间</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="entry in statsVisible" :key="entry.key"><td>{{entry.label}}</td><td>{{entry.mailCount}} / {{entry.roleDayCount}}</td><td v-for="item in statsColumns" :key="item.id" :class="resourceClass(item.id)">{{statsAmount(entry,item.id)}}</td><td>{{entry.from}} — {{entry.to}}</td></tr><tr v-if="!statsEntries.length"><td :colspan="statsColumns.length+3" class="dojo-empty">当前范围暂无记录</td></tr></tbody></table></div><footer class="dojo-stats-pager"><span>共 {{statsEntries.length}} 项 · 第 {{statsPage+1}} / {{statsPages}} 页</span><div><button :disabled="statsPage===0" @click="statsPage--">上一页</button><button :disabled="statsPage>=statsPages-1" @click="statsPage++">下一页</button></div></footer></div><div class="dojo-daily-layout" v-else-if="view==='daily'"><aside class="dojo-role-list" aria-label="日报角色" :aria-busy="groupSaving"><div class="resource-role-nav-head"><span>角色</span><small>{{resourceRoles.length}} 位</small></div><input class="resource-role-search" aria-label="搜索资源角色" placeholder="搜索角色 / 区服" v-model="roleSearch"><div class="resource-role-scroll"><section v-for="g in groupedResourceRoles" :key="g.id" class="resource-role-group" :data-resource-group="g.id"><button v-if="g.showHeader" class="resource-group-toggle" draggable="true" :disabled="groupSaving||busy" :class="{'drag-group-target':roleDrag.hoverGroup.value===g.id,'group-dragging':roleDrag.groupDragged.value===g.id,'group-drop-before':roleDrag.groupHovered.value===g.id&&!roleDrag.groupAfter.value,'group-drop-after':roleDrag.groupHovered.value===g.id&&roleDrag.groupAfter.value}" @dragstart="roleDrag.startGroup($event,g.id)" @dragend="roleDrag.clear" @dragover="roleDrag.overGroup($event,g.id)" @drop="roleDrag.drop($event,g.id)" @click="toggleResourceGroup($event,g)" @keydown.alt.up.prevent="moveResourceGrou